//
// RECEIVERS
//    otlp                    - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/otelcol/otelcol.receiver.otlp/
// PROCESSORS:
//    memory_limiter          - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/otelcol/otelcol.processor.memory_limiter/
//    filter                  - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/otelcol/otelcol.processor.filter/
//    tail_sampling           - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/otelcol/otelcol.processor.tail_sampling/
//    batch                   - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/otelcol/otelcol.processor.batch/
// EXPORTERS
//    OTLP exporter           - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/otelcol/otelcol.exporter.otlp/
//    Prometheus remote_write - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/prometheus/prometheus.remote_write/
// LOGS:
//    1) discovery.docker     - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/discovery/discovery.docker/
//    2) discovery.relabel    - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/discovery/discovery.relabel/
//    3) source.docker        - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/loki/loki.source.docker/
//    4) loki.process         - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/loki/loki.process/
//    5) loki.write           - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/loki/loki.write/
// ALLOY METRICS:
//    prometheus.scrape       - https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/prometheus/prometheus.scrape/
// =====================================================================================================================
